{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Juju Injection raises Agility, Intellect and Spirit by the same percent",
  "contract": "Juju Injection (CharacterAdvancement entry 7088, rank 1 spell 503608, rank 2 spell 503609) raised Agility and Intellect only, which leaves the Spirit specialization Brewing with nothing to multiply. AscensionWitchDoctorCompletion.cpp gives both ranks a third effect, aura 137 (SPELL_AURA_MOD_TOTAL_STAT_PERCENTAGE) on Spirit with the same base points as the other two (5 percent, then 10 percent in total: rank 2 replaces rank 1 and does not add to it). A level 80 Witch Doctor picks Brewing (ChrSpecs 6) and learns each rank, and the three aura effect amounts are asserted exactly. Stamina is the unchanged control. Character sheet stats are whole numbers, so the stat ratios use bands and a guard first asserts that each raised stat is at least 50, which keeps the rounding inside them (rank 1 floor 1.05 - 1/50 stays above 1.03; rank 2 floor 1.10 - 1/50 stays above 1.08, and the two bands do not overlap); 15 percent in total would fail the rank 2 band. The client tooltip is not observed.",
